{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sunrise-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sunrise-bay-emaar-beach-front","about":"Sunrise Bay is a coastal residential complex consisting of two 26-storey buildings. The project consists of two completely identical towers connected by a five-storey podium, inside which are located shopping center, stores, restaurants and recreation area with a swimming pool.The complex offers stylish apartments with 1-4 bedrooms, which offer spectacular views of the Arabian Gulf or the marina. The layouts of the residences are spacious and functional, the interior is made in loft style, there is a fully equipped kitchen, spacious bathroom, built-in closet, laundry room, open balcony, panoramic windows. Apartments with 2-4 bedrooms are complemented by walk-in closets.Residents have access to premium amenities: private beach, underground parking, 24-hour security, panoramic infinity pool, children's play area, equipped gym.The infrastructure of this neighborhood is carefully planned for permanent residence and convenient business. It will take less than 5 minutes by car to reach Dubai Marina. Within 10-15 minutes drive are Berlitz Private School, Raffles Nursery School, Marina Medical Center, Drs. Nicolas &amp; Asp. Residents have access to public transportation: monorail, buses and streetcars. A quick exit to Sheikh Zayed Road provides easy access to the main locations of Dubai.","price":6250000,"title":"Sunrise Bay","bitrix":{"id":432,"pf_id":"are.3.9798","source":null,"project_id":"EMAAR Beachfront","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sunrise Bay","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Dubai Harbour"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1089/images/2024/02/22/340x252/4WdRAG9K6LcAVhTXKPVop2jUWNeuCwmal9iIheL4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/10